stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROPOSED
  PROPOSED --> READY: Prerequisites valid
  PROPOSED --> DISMISSED: User declines
  PROPOSED --> EXPIRED: Inputs no longer apply
  READY --> IN_PROGRESS: Durable run starts
  READY --> DISMISSED: User declines
  READY --> EXPIRED: Context invalidated
  IN_PROGRESS --> WAITING_FOR_USER: Review or confirmation needed
  WAITING_FOR_USER --> IN_PROGRESS: Valid reviewed input
  WAITING_FOR_USER --> DISMISSED: User cancels remaining work
  WAITING_FOR_USER --> EXPIRED: Proposal no longer valid
  IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: Durable result receipt
  IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED: Recoverable or terminal failure recorded
  IN_PROGRESS --> DISMISSED: Cancel reconciled
  FAILED --> READY: Retry after revalidation
  FAILED --> DISMISSED: User stops
  FAILED --> EXPIRED: No longer actionable
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  DISMISSED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
